<title>USA: Evanston, Ill., $36 mln GOs won by Raymond James.</title>
<headline>Evanston, Ill., $36 mln GOs won by Raymond James.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Raymond James &amp; Associates Inc. said Tuesday it won $36 million Evanston, Ill., general obligation bonds at a net interest cost of 5.42 percent.</p>
</text>
